+ the best) place for the adverb in each is where it would split an infinitive. *Such gentlemen are powerless to analyse* correctly *agricultural conditions./A body of Unionist employers which still has power to influence* greatly *opinion among those who work for them./Might I* kindly *ask you to forward?* The place into which each adverb has been shifted
